<title>UK: Premier see continued good performance in Q1.</title>
<headline>Premier see continued good performance in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British oil and gas group Premier Oil Plc on Wednesday said last year's strong performance has continued into the first quarter.</p>
<p>&quot;It is a positive indication of a good year to come,&quot; chairman Barrie Stephens told the annual general meeting.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
